build: 2026-06-24 v10.76.15 (STABILITY: fix launch crash + UI hang — one sheet/cover)
branch: claude/piano-roll-clip-view-wozlie
notesT: Critical stability fix. 10.76.14 wouldn't launch, and the app sometimes hung
  ("can't click anything") or crashed. Root cause: the main view attached 16 .sheet + 3
  .fullScreenCover modifiers; when two became true at once (the crash-diagnostic auto-
  surfacing at launch over another presentation; tool/intent paths) SwiftUI installed an
  invisible tap-blocking layer / crashed, and the deep modifier nesting also risked the
  metadata launch-overflow. FIX: consolidated to ONE .sheet(item:) + ONE
  .fullScreenCover(item:) driven by computed bindings over the existing flags, so only a
  single presentation can ever be live and dismiss clears the flags. This also flattens
  the body type (19 modifiers to 2). No feature changes; all tools/visual unchanged.
  INSTALL 10.76.15 and confirm it launches + nothing freezes.
